  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INCAF chairmanship activities - INCAF Task Team m&#xf6;te (Paris) 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">INCAF ordf&#xf6;randeskap aktiviteter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidraget utg&#xf6;r support till &quot;the Task Team on Financing and Aid architecture of the OECD International Network on Conflict and Fragility&quot;. Sida agerar ordf&#xf6;rande i ovan n&#xe4;mnt Task Team, och bidraget anv&#xe4;nds till att t&#xe4;cka kostnader f&#xf6;r konsultationer, koordinering och konsultj&#xe4;nster.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution covers support to the Task Team on Financing and Aid architecture of the OECD International Network on Conflict and Fragility. Sida chairs above mentioned Task Team, and the contribution is used to cover expenses for consultations, coordination and consulting services.</narrative>
  </description>
